{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268llBgyn5cq1794393493.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>政府計劃收緊電話卡實名登記制，由現時每人可向每間電訊商登記最多十張，減少至三張。</p><p></p><p>商務及經濟發展局局長丘應樺，在立法會大會回覆議員質詢時指，根據電訊商的數據分析，約九成八個人用戶登記不多於三張儲值卡，預期大幅下調可登記數量上限，有助減少被不法之徒濫用作詐騙，亦同時確保不會影響絕大多數用戶。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.L.SIMCARD-1600-1_CLEAN_20261111_175902_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269p3X9bl6J31794393524.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>政府亦建議將多項涉及電話卡的不當行為刑事化，如無合法權限或辯解下，提供個人資料讓他人登記電話卡，和以買賣及租借等方式提供或獲取已登記的電話卡。</p><p></p><p>政府正積極籌備修改相關法例，計劃在未來數月作諮詢。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:17:02.313865+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:26.057230+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:10:26.131034+00:00","content_hash":"20ef5164a3f714e47adcc7c22d453fc4d48beb6d0e46846b18d5daac0118d310","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:17:02.313865+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}